**Need to make a beat live again? Learn how to unarchive your beats on Beat22 and restore them to active status in a few simple steps.**

1.  **Go to Your Dashboard**
    1.  -   Log into your Beat22 seller account and head over to your dashboard.
2.  ******Click on Browse at the top******
    
    ![Click on Browse at the top](/images/2025/06/Screenshot-2025-06-30-210101.png)
    
3.  ****Click on “My Beats”****
    
    ![Click on “My Beats”](/images/2025/06/Screenshot-2025-06-30-205058.png)
    
4.  ****Click on the “Archived” Button****
    
    ![Click on the “Archived” Button](/images/2025/06/Screenshot-2025-07-01-001907.png)
    
5.  ****A pop-up will appear, select “Yes” to confirm. Your beat will be moved back to Active status.****
    
    ![A pop-up will appear, select “Yes” to confirm. Your beat will be moved back to Active status.](/images/2025/06/Screenshot-2025-07-01-001918.png)
